{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-04-11 13:00:00', 'title': 'HII IS AWARDED CONTRACT MODIFICATION FOR COLUMBIA-CLASS BALLISTIC MISSILE SUBMARINES', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., APRIL 11, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION HAS BEEN AWARDED A $567.6 MILLION SUBCONTRACT MODIFICATION FROM GENERAL DYNAMICS ELECTRIC BOAT TO PROVIDE LONG-LEAD-TIME MATERIAL AND ADVANCE CONSTRUCTION ACTIVITIES FOR COLUMBIA-CLASS BALLISTIC MISSILE SUBMARINES.'}